<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#111310">
  <meta name="description" content="Explore sports, follow copy staking strategies and track every move in your EDGE wallet. Your game. Your edge.">
  <title>EDGE — Every game. A new edge.</title>
  <link rel="icon" href="/assets/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml">
  <link rel="preload" href="/assets/fonts/barlow-condensed-800.ttf" as="font" type="font/ttf" crossorigin>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/fonts.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/landing.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/marketing.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/motion.css">
  <script src="/assets/motion.js" defer></script>
  <script src="/assets/landing.js" defer></script>
</head>
<body class="landing-body" data-edge-preload="page">
  <a class="skip-link" href="#main-content">Skip to content</a>
  <div id="edge-page-loader" class="edge-page-loader" aria-hidden="true" hidden><span class="edge-loader-mark">EDGE<span>✳</span></span><span class="edge-loader-caption">GETTING THE GAME READY</span></div>
  @include('marketing.header')

  <main id="main-content">
    <section class="landing-hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
      <div class="hero-technical"><span>SPORTS. STRATEGY. YOUR NEXT MOVE.</span><span>BUILT FOR THE LOVE OF THE GAME <span class="technical-cross" aria-hidden="true">+</span></span></div>
      <div class="hero-composition">
        <div class="landing-hero-copy" data-reveal>
          <p class="landing-eyebrow"><span class="live-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span> THIS IS YOUR HOME GROUND</p>
          <h1 id="hero-title">EVERY GAME.<br>A NEW<br><span>EDGE.</span><i aria-hidden="true">✳</i></h1>
          <p class="hero-description">Make your own picks. Follow a strategy.<br>Keep every move in view.</p>
          <div class="hero-buttons"><a class="landing-button green" href="/app?auth=register#sports">Get in the game <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="hero-explore" href="#the-game">Explore EDGE <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div>
        </div>
        <div class="landing-hero-visual">
          <img class="nfl-hero" src="/assets/game-nfl.jpg" width="960" height="1763" fetchpriority="high" alt="NFL quarterback Tom Brady in a New England Patriots helmet preparing to throw a football">
          <div class="hero-photo-shade" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          <span class="hero-photo-caption">THE MOMENT IS YOURS. / 001</span>
          <div class="hero-image-stamp" aria-hidden="true"><span>ALL IN<br>THE GAME.</span><i>↗</i></div>
          <span class="hero-image-coordinate" aria-hidden="true">EDGE / FIELD NOTES</span>
          <span class="nfl-photo-credit">Photo: <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Tom_Brady.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Keith Allison</a> · <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">CC BY-SA 2.0</a></span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-baseline"><span>01 — SPORTS & GAMES</span><span>02 — COPY STAKING</span><span>03 — YOUR WALLET</span><span class="hero-baseline-last">PLAY SMART. STAY IN CONTROL. <b>18+</b></span></div>
    </section>

    <div class="landing-statement" data-reveal><span class="statement-mark" aria-hidden="true">✳</span><p>MORE THAN A PICK.<br><span>A WAY TO FOLLOW THE GAME.</span></p><a href="/app#sports" class="circle-link" aria-label="Explore sports"><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>

    <section class="game-story landing-section" id="the-game" aria-labelledby="game-title">
      <div class="section-topline"><span>THE PLAYBOOK / 01</span><span>MAKE YOUR MOVE</span></div>
      <div class="game-story-layout">
        <div class="game-story-image" data-reveal><img src="/assets/game-basketball.jpg" width="1000" height="1500" loading="lazy" alt="Basketball player preparing a shot on an outdoor court"><span class="image-label">FROM THE PITCH.<br>TO THE COURT.</span><span class="image-corner" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div>
        <div class="game-story-copy" data-reveal>
          <span class="landing-eyebrow">YOUR CALL. YOUR GAME.</span>
          <h2 id="game-title">KNOW THE<br>GAME.<br><span>MAKE THE PLAY.</span></h2>
          <p>Explore available fixtures, compare the odds and build your stake. Choose a single pick or bring your selections together in a multiple.</p>
          <div class="game-details"><div><span>01</span><p><strong>Pick your market</strong>Find the teams and events you want to follow.</p></div><div><span>02</span><p><strong>See your numbers</strong>Review your stake and potential return before you confirm.</p></div><div><span>03</span><p><strong>Follow the result</strong>Final scores settle each stake in your account.</p></div></div>
          <a href="/app#sports" class="landing-text-link">Explore the fixtures <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="copy-story landing-section" id="copy-staking" aria-labelledby="copy-title">
      <div class="section-topline"><span>A SHARED EDGE / 02</span><span>THE STRATEGY. THE WHOLE STORY.</span></div>
      <div class="copy-story-heading" data-reveal><h2 id="copy-title">FOLLOW A STRATEGY.<br><span>SEE EVERY MOVE.</span></h2><div><p>Fund a copy staking allocation and follow the master’s future picks. Your chart begins with your deposit, then moves with every settled result.</p><a href="/app#copy" class="landing-text-link">Discover copy staking <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div>
      <div class="copy-preview" data-reveal>
        <div class="copy-preview-sidebar"><span class="landing-eyebrow">COPY STAKING / A CLOSER LOOK</span><span class="preview-strategy-icon" aria-hidden="true">✳</span><h3>THE GAME.<br>IN NUMBERS.</h3><p>Wins add net profit.<br>Losses subtract the copied stake.<br>Every result stays in view.</p><div class="illustration-badge">ILLUSTRATIVE EXAMPLE</div><p class="illustration-note">Fictional teams and results demonstrate the chart. This is not actual performance or a forecast.</p></div>
        <div class="copy-preview-main">
          <div class="preview-chart-heading"><div><span class="landing-eyebrow">EXAMPLE CAPITAL / USD</span><strong id="preview-capital">$21,500<span>.00</span></strong></div><div class="preview-selection"><span id="preview-event">East City vs West United · Won</span><strong id="preview-change" class="positive">+$900.00</strong></div></div>
          <div class="preview-chart" aria-label="Illustrative copy staking capital chart">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 640 230" role="img" aria-labelledby="preview-chart-title preview-chart-description"><title id="preview-chart-title">An example deposit, two wins and one loss</title><desc id="preview-chart-description">An initial deposit of 20,000 US dollars rises to 21,600 after a win, falls to 20,600 after a loss, then rises to 21,500 after another win. These results are illustrative.</desc><defs><linearGradient id="preview-chart-fill" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1"><stop offset="0%" stop-color="#00e995" stop-opacity=".24"/><stop offset="100%" stop-color="#00e995" stop-opacity="0"/></linearGradient></defs><g class="preview-grid"><path d="M42 25H625M42 90H625M42 155H625M42 210H625"/></g><g class="preview-axis"><text x="0" y="29">22K</text><text x="0" y="94">21K</text><text x="0" y="159">20K</text></g><path class="preview-baseline" d="M42 155H625"/><path fill="url(#preview-chart-fill)" d="M55 155L240 51L425 116L610 57.5V210H55Z"/><path class="preview-line" d="M55 155L240 51L425 116L610 57.5"/><g class="preview-dot"><circle cx="55" cy="155" r="5"/><circle cx="240" cy="51" r="5"/><circle cx="425" cy="116" r="5" class="loss"/><circle cx="610" cy="57.5" r="5"/></g></svg>
            <button class="preview-point point-deposit" type="button" data-preview-point="0" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="Initial deposit, capital 20,000 US dollars"><span></span></button><button class="preview-point point-win-one" type="button" data-preview-point="1" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="Northside FC versus Riverside FC won, capital 21,600 US dollars"><span></span></button><button class="preview-point point-loss" type="button" data-preview-point="2" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="Harbour FC versus Athletic Town lost, capital 20,600 US dollars"><span></span></button><button class="preview-point point-win-two" type="button" data-preview-point="3" aria-pressed="true" aria-label="East City versus West United won, capital 21,500 US dollars"><span></span></button>
          </div>
          <div class="preview-chart-foot"><span>INITIAL DEPOSIT <strong>$20,000</strong></span><span>SELECT A POINT TO EXPLORE <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span></div>
          <div class="preview-games-heading"><h4>The master’s games</h4><span>EXAMPLE RESULTS</span></div>
          <ol class="preview-games" aria-label="Illustrative master game results"><li><button type="button" data-preview-game="1" aria-pressed="false"><span class="preview-game-teams">Northside FC <small>vs</small> Riverside FC</span><span class="preview-game-result won">Won</span><strong class="positive">+$1,600.00</strong></button></li><li><button type="button" data-preview-game="2" aria-pressed="false"><span class="preview-game-teams">Harbour FC <small>vs</small> Athletic Town</span><span class="preview-game-result lost">Lost</span><strong class="negative">−$1,000.00</strong></button></li><li><button type="button" data-preview-game="3" aria-pressed="true"><span class="preview-game-teams">East City <small>vs</small> West United</span><span class="preview-game-result won">Won</span><strong class="positive">+$900.00</strong></button></li></ol>
          <p class="preview-risk">Staking involves risk. Your capital can decrease, and returns are not guaranteed.</p><p id="preview-announcement" class="screen-reader-only" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"></p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="wallet-story landing-section" id="your-wallet" aria-labelledby="wallet-title">
      <div class="section-topline"><span>YOUR WALLET / 03</span><span>EVERY MOVE, ACCOUNTED FOR.</span></div>
      <div class="wallet-story-heading" data-reveal><h2 id="wallet-title">YOUR FUNDS.<br>YOUR <span>CONTROL.</span></h2><div class="wallet-roundel" aria-hidden="true">↗</div></div>
      <div class="wallet-story-bottom" data-reveal><p>One place for deposits, stakes, settled returns and withdrawal requests. Follow the status of your money from the first deposit to the next move.</p><ol class="wallet-steps"><li><span>01 / FUND</span><h3>Make a deposit.</h3><p>Choose an available payment method and follow the instructions in your wallet.</p></li><li><span>02 / FOLLOW</span><h3>Track your activity.</h3><p>View stakes, results and deposit updates in your transaction history.</p></li><li><span>03 / WITHDRAW</span><h3>Request a withdrawal.</h3><p>Submit your bank details and follow your request through admin review.</p></li></ol></div>
    </section>

    <section class="faq-section landing-section" id="questions" aria-labelledby="faq-title">
      <div class="faq-intro" data-reveal><span class="landing-eyebrow">A FEW THINGS TO KNOW</span><h2 id="faq-title">BEFORE<br>YOU <span>PLAY.</span></h2><span class="faq-star" aria-hidden="true">✳</span></div>
      <div class="faq-list" data-reveal>
        <details><summary>How does copy staking work?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>Choose a strategy and move an allocation from your wallet into it. Your active position copies future picks published for that strategy. You can pause future copying or return available funds to your wallet; unsettled stakes must finish before a position can close.</p></details>
        <details><summary>What changes the copy staking chart?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>The chart starts at your deposit. A settled win adds the net profit, and a settled loss deducts that game’s copied stake. Pending games do not move the chart. The master’s games and their results appear underneath.</p></details>
        <details><summary>How do deposits and withdrawals work?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>Your wallet shows the payment methods currently available. For a manual deposit, follow the bank instructions and submit your transfer reference for verification. To withdraw, submit your bank details and amount; the funds are reserved while an administrator reviews your request.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Are returns guaranteed?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>No. All staking carries risk, including copy staking. A strategy can lose games and your allocated capital can decrease. Review each strategy, use an amount you can afford to lose and stay in control of your activity.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Can I explore before creating an account?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>Yes. You can browse available sports and copy staking strategies first. Create an account or sign in when you want to manage your wallet, place a stake or fund a copy position.</p></details>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="landing-final" aria-labelledby="final-title"><div class="final-topline"><span>THE NEXT MOVE IS YOURS.</span><span class="final-plus" aria-hidden="true">+</span><span>YOUR GAME. YOUR EDGE.</span></div><div class="final-content" data-reveal><h2 id="final-title">GET IN.<br><span>FIND YOUR EDGE.</span></h2><a class="final-cta" href="/app?auth=register#sports" aria-label="Create an EDGE account"><span>LET’S GO</span><i aria-hidden="true">↗</i></a></div></section>
  </main>
  @include('marketing.footer')
</body>
</html>
